:"Scorched-Scent Propeller","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_10153_nsblon_2","slug":"powerful_balloon","name":"Powerful Balloon","database_level":0}],"suppliedUnits":{"fixed_squad":[],"deployable_tokens":[]},"hasConditionalSpawns":false},"borrowedGeometryFrom":null,"enemyDetails":{"flying_toaster_with_jam":{"slug":"flying_toaster_with_jam","name":"Flying Toaster (With Jam)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Flying Toaster (With Jam).webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A crisp beep, then fresh toast spread with jam falls directly onto your plate.\nRestaurants that use it typically require customers to take off their hats. Not for good manners, but because it often mistakes hats for plates.","abilities":["Flying unit.","When not blocked, continuously deals splash damage to surrounding allied units"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":400,"def":300,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"skybuster_soda_sour_and_spicy":{"slug":"skybuster_soda_sour_and_spicy","name":"Skybuster Soda (Sour and Spicy)","icon":"/enemies-icons/Skybuster Soda (Sour and Spicy).webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Shake the bottle vigorously for three hundred seconds then pry the cap open according to the instructions, and it will shoot into the sky with immense force. Don't worry, the bottle is made of high-toughness acrylic that will not break easily.\nThe soda inside is a strong sour and spicy flavor. Do not open indoors.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Gradually accelerates when moving, but loses HP over time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":400,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"powerful_balloon":